inline-block h-1.5 w-2.5 border-[1.5px] border-ink bg-transparent"></span>searching</span></div></div></div><p class="mt-2.5 text-body text-stone-600">Three silences landed a point; one was searching.</p><div class="card mt-5 grid grid-cols-3 divide-x divide-hairline"><div class="min-w-0 px-3 py-4"><div class="label-micro whitespace-nowrap">WPM</div><div class="font-display mt-1.5 text-num-m tabular-nums">145</div><div class="mt-1 text-caption text-balance text-stone-500">in the zone</div></div><div class="min-w-0 px-3 py-4"><div class="label-micro whitespace-nowrap">Held pauses</div><div class="font-display mt-1.5 text-num-m tabular-nums">4</div><div class="mt-1 text-caption text-balance text-stone-500">≥0.8s each</div></div><div class="min-w-0 px-3 py-4"><div class="label-micro whitespace-nowrap">Length</div><div class="font-display mt-1.5 text-num-m tabular-nums">62<span class="text-body font-bold text-stone-500">s</span></div><div class="mt-1 text-caption text-balance text-stone-500"><span class="whitespace-nowrap">target 60 to 90s</span></div></div></div><section class="mt-7"><h2 class="section-head">The measured dimensions</h2><div class="mt-3"><div class="card px-4 py-1"><details class="border-b border-hairline py-3 last:border-b-0"><summary data-trait="pause" class="relative flex min-h-6 cursor-pointer select-none list-none items-center gap-3 after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:-inset-y-2.5 after:content-[&#x27;&#x27;] [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex w-[104px] shrink-0 items-center gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-3.5 w-[3px] shrink-0 tone-fill"></span><span class="font-display min-w-0 truncate text-row font-bold">Pausing</span></span><span class="h-1.5 flex-1 overflow-hidden bg-sand"><span class="block h-full bg-sage-600 " style="width:72%"></span></span><span class="grid w-[66px] shrink-0 grid-cols-[1fr_34px] items-baseline"><span class="font-display text-right text-body font-extrabold tabular-nums">108</span><span class="font-display text-left text-caption font-semibold tabular-nums text-stone-500">/150</span></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="disclosure-mark shrink-0 text-stone-400"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="m6 9.5 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></summary><div class="reveal mt-2 pl-[11px] text-caption leading-relaxed text-stone-500">Three silences landed a point; one was searching.</div></details><details class="border-b border-hairline py-3 last:border-b-0"><summary data-trait="fillers" class="relative flex min-h-6 cursor-pointer select-none list-none items-center gap-3 after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:-inset-y-2.5 after:content-[&#x27;&#x27;] [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex w-[104px] shrink-0 items-center gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-3.5 w-[3px] shrink-0 tone-fill"></span><span class="font-display min-w-0 truncate text-row font-bold">Fillers</span></span><span class="h-1.5 flex-1 overflow-hidden bg-sand"><span class="block h-full bg-sage-600 " style="width:55.00000000000001%"></span></span><span class="grid w-[66px] shrink-0 grid-cols-[1fr_34px] items-baseline"><span class="font-display text-right text-body font-extrabold tabular-nums">55</span><span class="font-display text-left text-caption font-semibold tabular-nums text-stone-500">/100</span></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="disclosure-mark shrink-0 text-stone-400"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="m6 9.5 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></summary><div class="reveal mt-2 pl-[11px] text-caption leading-relaxed text-stone-500">All fillers / min: 3.9 (4 in all). None scores 100; 8 a minute scores 0. Most of them were “um”.<div class="mt-1 text-stone-600">↳ Replace it with silence, not a different word.</div></div></details><details class="border-b border-hairline py-3 last:border-b-0"><summary data-trait="repairs" class="relative flex min-h-6 cursor-pointer select-none list-none items-center gap-3 after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:-inset-y-2.5 after:content-[&#x27;&#x27;] [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex w-[104px] shrink-0 items-center gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-3.5 w-[3px] shrink-0 tone-fill"></span><span class="font-display min-w-0 truncate text-row font-bold">Restarts</span></span><span class="h-1.5 flex-1 overflow-hidden bg-sand"><span class="block h-full bg-sage-600 " style="width:66%"></span></span><span class="grid w-[66px] shrink-0 grid-cols-[1fr_34px] items-baseline"><span class="font-display text-right text-body font-extrabold tabular-nums">33</span><span class="font-display text-left text-caption font-semibold tabular-nums text-stone-500">/50</span></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="disclosure-mark shrink-0 text-stone-400"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="m6 9.5 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></summary><div class="reveal mt-2 pl-[11px] text-caption leading-relaxed text-stone-500">1 restarted phrase, 1 a minute. None scores 100; 3 a minute scores 0.<div class="mt-1 text-stone-600">↳ Finish the sentence, then say the better one. A restart makes the listener re-follow you.</div></div></details><details class="border-b border-hairline py-3 last:border-b-0"><summary data-trait="pace" class="relative flex min-h-6 cursor-pointer select-none list-none items-center gap-3 after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:-inset-y-2.5 after:content-[&#x27;&#x27;] [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex w-[104px] shrink-0 items-center gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-3.5 w-[3px] shrink-0 tone-fill"></span><span class="font-display min-w-0 truncate text-row font-bold">Pace</span></span><span class="h-1.5 flex-1 overflow-hidden bg-sand"><span class="block h-full bg-sage-600 " style="width:93%"></span></span><span class="grid w-[66px] shrink-0 grid-cols-[1fr_34px] items-baseline"><span class="font-display text-right text-body font-extrabold tabular-nums">93</span><span class="font-display text-left text-caption font-semibold tabular-nums text-stone-500">/100</span></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="disclosure-mark shrink-0 text-stone-400"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="m6 9.5 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></summary><div class="reveal mt-2 pl-[11px] text-caption leading-relaxed text-stone-500">145 words a minute against the 130 to 160 zone, plus a bonus when pace moves.</div></details><details class="border-b border-hairline py-3 last:border-b-0"><summary data-trait="range" class="relative flex min-h-6 cursor-pointer select-none list-none items-center gap-3 after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:-inset-y-2.5 after:content-[&#x27;&#x27;] [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex w-[104px] shrink-0 items-center gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-3.5 w-[3px] shrink-0 tone-fill"></span><span class="font-display min-w-0 truncate text-row font-bold">Variety</span></span><span class="h-1.5 flex-1 overflow-hidden bg-sand"><span class="block h-full bg-sage-600 " style="width:66%"></span></span><span class="grid w-[66px] shrink-0 grid-cols-[1fr_34px] items-baseline"><span class="font-display text-right text-body font-extrabold tabular-nums">66</span><span class="font-display text-left text-caption font-semibold tabular-nums text-stone-500">/100</span></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="disclosure-mark shrink-0 text-stone-400"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="m6 9.5 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></summary><div class="reveal mt-2 pl-[11px] text-caption leading-relaxed text-stone-500">Distinct words against repeats and crutch words (“really”, “very”, “thing”).</div></details><div class="flex items-center gap-3 border-t border-hairline py-3"><span class="flex-1 pl-[11px] text-caption font-semibold text-stone-500">5 dimensions, added up</span><span class="grid w-[66px] shrink-0 grid-cols-[1fr_34px] items-baseline"><span class="font-display text-right text-body font-extrabold tabular-nums">355</span><span class="font-display text-left text-caption font-semibold tabular-nums text-stone-500">/500</span></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="w-3.5 shrink-0"></span></div><p class="border-t border-hairline py-3 text-caption leading-relaxed text-stone-500">The coach didn&#x27;t run this time. These 5 measured dimensions cover 500 of the 1000; without the judged ones there is no Ethos Index.</p></div></div></section><section class="mt-7"><h2 class="section-head">Every filler<span class="section-head-count">4</span></h2><div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5"><span class="rounded-full bg-stone-100 px-2.5 py-1 text-caption text-ink">um <span class="tabular-nums text-stone-500">0:02</span></span><span class="rounded-full bg-stone-100 px-2.5 py-1 text-caption text-ink">like <span class="tabular-nums text-stone-500">0:07</span></span><span class="rounded-full bg-stone-100 px-2.5 py-1 text-caption text-ink">um <span class="tabular-nums text-stone-500">0:10</span></span><span class="rounded-full bg-stone-100 px-2.5 py-1 text-caption text-ink">you know <span class="tabular-nums text-stone-500">0:15</span></span></div></section><section class="mt-7"><h2 class="section-head">What you said<span class="section-head-count">12 words</span></h2><div aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-1 t